abstract: >-
  Benchmark software, a preregistered protocol, completed five-model primary
  artifacts, controls, a StarCoder2 stopping-rule ablation, and a technical
  report testing whether the HumanEval ranking in Qwen2.5-Coder Table 5
  survives local deployment.
